# Never commit credentials. The ROOT profiles.yml is committed BY DESIGN and
# is credential-free (dbt Projects on Snowflake reads it; execution uses the
# session identity). Local/CI identity lives in profiles.yml.template ->
# ~/.dbt/profiles.yml (see docs/ONBOARDING.md) — never commit a filled-in copy.
*.pem
*.p8
